+# Korean (ko) glossary for the RTX Remix menus
+
+Style: tooltips and messages are full sentences in 합니다체 (…합니다, …됩니다; instructions to the
+reader as …하십시오). Labels, buttons, headers and combo entries are noun phrases (e.g. "Enable Bloom" -> "블룸 활성화",
+"Show Lights" -> "조명 표시"). No trailing period on labels. Korean particles after Latin words or
+numbers follow the pronunciation (DLSS를, Remix를, GPU가, rtx.conf를, 1로, 0으로).
+
+Kept as written (never translated): rtx.* / dxvk.* option names, file names, environment variables,
+anything in backticks, key names (Alt+X, Ctrl, Shift), numbers and units, and product or technique
+names: RTX, Remix, NVIDIA, DLSS, DLSS-RR, DLSS-FG, DLAA, NRD, ReBLUR, ReLAX, ReSTIR, ReSTIR GI, RTXDI,
