+
+## Names left in English
+
+Texture category names and the atmosphere/volumetrics labels came in batch 16 (e.g. 地形紋理,
+為紋理加入光源（選用）, 未分類, 底部變暗, 夜空亮度, 每分鐘雷擊次數, 透射率色彩); tooltips quote
+them by these translations. Labels that are still not extracted (the weather preset editor's field
+table, e.g. Underside Shading) and names that are no menu label (Sun Shadow (Near), Surface
+Contrast, Transmittance Distance) stay English in 「」. GPU-override values True/False stay
+English: they are config values, the displayed labels are On/Off. Pass, enum and Vulkan identifiers in debug lists (FrameBegin, VK_IMAGE_TYPE_2D, D3DFOG_EXP)
+stay unchanged. Text in backticks stays; when it names a translated button, the Chinese label
+follows in （）. Weather preset ids in the Target Preset combo (clear, partlyCloudy, ...) stay
+English: the code passes the combo strings to setTargetPreset() and they are the
+rtx.weather.preset.<name> keys. Labels drawn through dragFloatWithWeatherOverride (Night Sky
+Brightness, Bottom Darkening, Sky Ambient Fill, ...) are not in remix.pot, so tooltips quote them in
+English.
